{
  "_comment": "Shared vectors of the server-side privacy redactor (#599). Go (redact_vectors_test.go) and the UI's live tester (apps/ui/src/lib/privacy-redact.test.ts) must both turn `in` into `want`. Wants come from Go: go test ./internal/controlplane/privacy -run TestRedactVectors -update",
  "vectors": [
    {
      "name": "path without query",
      "policy": {
        "mask_query_params": [],
        "mask_headers": [],
        "mask_body_fields": []
      },
      "op": "raw_path",
      "in": "/orders/42",
      "want": "/orders/42"
    },
    {
